## Database Schema (`core` schema in PostgreSQL)

Source of truth: **`create.sql`**. Never modify it without explicit instruction.

### `core.businesses`
Top-level multi-tenant grouping. Sentinel record
`id = '00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000009999'` (`__individual__`) is used for clients
not tied to any company.

### `core.clients`
One row per person. Key fields:
- `email_forward` — the `crgastostesting+{alias}@gmail.com` forwarding address
- `active` — only active clients are processed
- `business_id` — links to `core.businesses` (or sentinel for individuals)

### `core.transactions_raw`
One row per email. Written by `email_reader.py` at ingest time (Steps 1–3).

| Field | Notes |
|---|---|
| `id` | `uuid.uuid4()` generated at insert |
| `message_id` | Gmail message ID — dedup key |
| `thread_id` | Gmail thread ID |
| `individual_id` | Matched from `email_forward` on `To:` header |
| `business_id` | Copied from `core.clients.business_id` |
| `from_email` | `From:` header (may be client's address if forwarded) |
| `to_email` | `To:` header |
| `subject` | `Subject:` header |
| `body_text_full` | Full body (HTML→text preferred, plain text fallback, max 20,000 chars) |
| `body_condensed` | Keyword-filtered version of body (max 1,200 chars) |
| `ms_date` | `internalDate` from Gmail API (epoch ms) |
| `local_date` | `ms_date` converted to `America/Costa_Rica` |
| `label_source` | Always `'Finanzas Personales'` |
| `month` / `year` / `year_month` | Derived from `local_date`. `year_month` zero-padded: `'YYYY-MM'` |

Unique constraint: `(individual_id, message_id)`.
Fields removed from schema (do NOT use): `source`, `payload_json`, `processed`, `received_at`, `transaction_type_guess`, `errors`.

### `core.transactions_enriched`
One row per `transactions_raw` row. Written by `enricher.py` (Step 4).

| Field | Notes |
|---|---|
| `raw_id` | FK → `transactions_raw.id` |
| `bank` | Detected bank name: `'bac'`, `'promerica'`, `'davibank'`, or `NULL` |
| `merchant_guess` | Extracted merchant, title-cased |
| `amount_guess` | Numeric amount (`NUMERIC(14,2)`) |
| `currency_guess` | `'CRC'`, `'USD'`, or `'EUR'` |
| `desc_guess` | Human-readable description, e.g. `'Compra en Auto Mercado'` |
| `transaction_type_guess` | `'debito'` / `'credito'` / `'unknown'` |
| `transaction_status` | `'Procesado'` / `'Procesado parcialmente'` / `'Descartado'` / `'unknown'` |
| `amount_local` / `currency_local` / `fx_rate` / `fx_rate_date` | FX fields — **not yet implemented** |

Status logic:
- `'Procesado'` → all 4 guess fields populated
- `'Procesado parcialmente'` → `amount_guess` populated but not all others
- `'Descartado'` → `amount_guess` missing
- `'unknown'` → AI assistance was off and bank parser couldn't fill all fields

### `core.transactions_classified`
Step 5 — **not yet built**.
Key fields: `merchant`, `category`, `subcategory`, `permanent_rule`, `logic`,
`classified_by` (`'rules'` | `'openai'`), notification tracking.

### `core.categories`
Category catalog. Business-level or client-specific.
Unique on `(business_id, individual_id, category, subcategory)`.

