## Coding Conventions
- Python 3.11+
- `psycopg2` for Postgres — raw SQL only, no ORM
- `uuid.uuid4()` for all generated UUIDs
- All timestamps UTC internally; convert to `America/Costa_Rica` only for `local_date`
- `year_month` always zero-padded: `f"{year}-{month:02d}"`
- Never hardcode credentials — use `.env` / environment variables
- Bank-specific logic lives in `banks/` — `parser.py` and `email_reader.py` must stay bank-agnostic
- One function per responsibility

